          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The table contains data on urban population with water within 500 meters from dwelling. The urban population is broken down by sex and age. Water is defined as water bodies with at least 0.5 hectares. Location of dwelling is defined by coordinates of the address location to which an individual is registered.  Distance is calculated as the Euclidian distance between dwelling and water without regard to physical barriers such as major roads and railways.  \r\n  \r\nShares refer to the share of the population within each group with water within 300 meters from dwelling. ",
        "The aim has been to describe the situation as of 31 December 2010. "
      ],
